# 〈新たな実身に保存〉を、カーネル内の基本図形編集・基本文章編集・仮身一覧とプロセスとで同じにする
# (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. For each of the three, a copy (mkbig) is linked into BTRON,
# the desktop's first window (linkbig), and opened by a double press on that link, so that the
# window has the link it came from: first with the desktop's own editor (figproc, docproc,
# cabproc kernel), then with the process (1), each on a link of its own. One change is made
# (a rectangle or a link carried 100 across and 200 down, abc typed into the text), then
# 新たな実身に保存 of the menu (保存's second row), and the name the panel starts with
# (画用紙のコピー, 基本文章編集のコピー) taken with Enter. Exactly one object is made
# (objects new), and the link to it goes into BTRON: the last link of BTRON's record points at
# a copy whose record 0, read as stored, and name are the same, byte for byte, whichever
# editor saved it (sum keys link, with BTRON in front). The menu then opens with 保存 under
# the pointer: 閉じる, two rows up, closes the window and leaves 閉じる the row chosen last.
# The menu is opened at 500,400 with 閉じる under the pointer, the rows 20 apart (閉じる, a
# line, 保存, 表示, ...); 保存's own opens beside it, its first row on 保存's row.
# Keys: Enter 28.

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 基本図形編集
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 30 4
click 50 14
wait 300
linkbig 180 45
wait 300
dclick 190 52
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 800
click 111 128
drag 111 128 211 328
sync 600
objects
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 440
wait 300
move 650 440
move 650 461
wait 300
click 650 461
wait 1000
wait 800
shot sn_fig_k_ask
key 28
sync 600
wait 800
objects new
want ok 1
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 360
wait 300
click 510 360
sync 600
wait 800
click 50 14
sync 600
sum show keys link
keep fig

figproc 1
mkbig fig 30 4
click 50 14
wait 300
linkbig 180 70
wait 300
logmark
dclick 190 77
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 32 links 0 autoref 1 parent 1
wait 800
logmark
click 111 128
drag 111 128 211 328
expectsince figure: moved 1 by 100,200
objects
logmark
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 440
wait 300
move 650 440
move 650 461
wait 300
click 650 461
expectsince figure: chosen save.new
wait 800
shot sn_fig_p_ask
key 28
expectsince figure: saved as new (0)
wait 800
objects new
want ok 1
logmark
click 500 400 1
wait 800
move 510 360
wait 300
click 510 360
expectsince figure: chosen close
expectsince figure: closed
wait 800
click 50 14
sync 600
sum show keys link
same fig
figproc 0

